- **router2 eth2 is physically UP** — link state `UP,LOWER_UP`, IP `20.20.0.2/8`, packets flowing — the premise in the ticket is wrong.
- **`/etc/frr/daemons` on router2 has `ripd=no`** — RIP daemon is explicitly disabled.
